external/desp/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The single-step retrosynthesis inference code under external/desp/ is adapted
from DESP (Double-Ended Synthesis Planning):

    Yu et al., "Double-Ended Synthesis Planning with Goal-Constrained
    Bidirectional Search," NeurIPS 2024.
    https://github.com/coleygroup/desp

The template-based MLP single-step model weights (datasets/model_retro.pt) and
reaction templates originate from Retro* (Chen et al., ICML 2020) and are
distributed through the DESP release. These weights are downloaded separately
(see slime_retro/scripts/setup.sh) and are not redistributed in this repository.

    Chen et al., "Retro*: Learning Retrosynthetic Planning with Neural Guided
    A* Search," ICML 2020.

